Bootstrap Filters

Bootstrapning o‘zida Filter component yo‘q.
Filter/Search qilish uchun odatda jQuery ishlatiladi.

Asosiy mantiq:

Inputga yozasan
    ↓
jQuery yozilgan textni oladi
    ↓
Elementlarni tekshiradi
    ↓
Mos kelmasa → yashiradi
Mos kelsa → ko‘rsatadi
1. Table filter

Masalan, jadvaldagi ism, familiya yoki emailni qidirish:
<input id="myInput" type="text" placeholder="Search...">

<table id="myTable" class="table">
    <tr>
        <th>Firstname</th>
        <th>Lastname</th>
        <th>Email</th>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td>John</td>
        <td>Doe</td>
        <td>john@example.com</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td>Mary</td>
        <td>Moe</td>
        <td>mary@mail.com</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td>July</td>
        <td>Dooley</td>
        <td>july@greatstuff.com</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<script>
$(document).ready(function(){
    $("#myInput").on("keyup", function() {

        var value = $(this).val().toLowerCase();

        $("#myTable tr").filter(function() {

            $(this).toggle(
                $(this).text().toLowerCase().indexOf(value) > -1
            );

        });
    });
});
</script>
id="myInput"
→ Qidiruv inputi

keyup
→ Har safar klaviaturadan yozilganda ishlaydi

.val()
→ Input ichidagi qiymatni oladi

.toLowerCase()
→ Hammasini kichik harfga o'tkazadi

$("#myTable tr")
→ Jadvaldagi barcha qatorlarni oladi

.filter()
→ Qatorlarni tekshiradi

.text()
→ Qator ichidagi textni oladi

.indexOf(value)
→ Qidirilayotgan text bor-yo‘qligini tekshiradi

.toggle()
→ Mos kelganini ko‘rsatadi,
  mos kelmaganini yashiradi
